 user running it needs access to both (see /usr/share/doc/yserver/setup.md).
 It runs full MATE/XFCE/Cinnamon/Plasma desktops and window managers such as
 FVWM3, e16 and wmaker, and implements a broad set of extensions (Composite,
 DAMAGE, DRI3, GLX, Present, RANDR, RENDER, SHAPE, SYNC, XFIXES, XInput, and
 more).
 .
 This package provides the standalone DRM/KMS server (yserver) and starty(1),
